  "steps": [
    "Cube the chicken, mix with the seasonings and oil and set aside.",
    "Put the onions and sun-dried tomatoes in a large oven dish with the seasonings and a spray of oil, mix, put the garlic bulb in the middle and cover with foil. Bake 45 minutes at 190 °C, checking halfway, until golden and caramelised.",
    "Squeeze in the garlic and, while the dish is hot, stir in the parsley, soy sauce, Parmesan, milk and cream cheese until melted and creamy. Return to a low oven to thicken slightly if needed, then fold in the cooked pasta.",
    "Spread the chicken on a lined sheet pan and bake 18 minutes at 200 °C, then grill briefly to char.",
    "Divide pasta and chicken into 6 portions."
